      <h2>leptris gem <span class="pill">v1.3.0</span></h2>
      <p><span class="pill periwinkle">2026-08-23</span> — the Ruby binding, in lockstep with libleptris v1.3.0.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>EXSLT in Ruby</strong> — <code>Document#exslt</code> enables the first-party <code>str:</code>/<code>set:</code>/<code>math:</code> function pack as native C handlers on that document.</li>
        <li><strong><code>Document#last_error</code></strong> — per-document error retrieval, the thread-safe successor to the library-global string; <code>leptris_thread_cleanup</code> bound for worker-thread exit.</li>
