      <h2>leptris gem <span class="pill">v1.2.0</span></h2>
      <p><span class="pill periwinkle">2026-08-23</span> — the Ruby binding, in lockstep with libleptris v1.2.0.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong><code>Leptris::XML::Document.create</code></strong> — an empty document with its own memory pool; build from scratch, no sentinel parse.</li>
